sentences.text:
This anticipatory application has been argued on the grounds that applicant is falsely implicated in this case; he was posted as Samiti Prabhandhak, Ishanagar, district Chhatarpur, since 1.4.2023;
along with other societies, his Society too was directed to provide the list of eligible farmers as on the date of 31.3.2023 for loan-waivers and said list was NEUTRAL CITATION NO.
2025:MPHC-JBP:17218 2 MCRC-11219-2025 prepared by earlier Society Manager Santosh Kumar Pateriya, who was holding the post till 31.3.2023; vide order dated 14.8.2024 the applicant was put under suspension but operation of this order was stayed in Writ Petition No.27484/2024 vide order dated 21.9.2024; a false FIR was registered under Sections 420 and 409 IPC against the applicant showing the wrongful disbursement of an amount of Rs.64,00,000/-.
